WEBVTT

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.127
You got it, bud.

00:00:14.215 --> 00:00:15.521
[growls]

00:00:15.695 --> 00:00:17.087
[Stoick] Hiccup!

00:00:19.264 --> 00:00:22.005
I'm sorry...
for everything.

00:00:22.702 --> 00:00:24.051
Yeah. Me, too.

00:00:24.225 --> 00:00:26.140
You don't have
to go up there.

00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:30.100
We're Vikings.
It's an occupational hazard.

00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:31.711
[dragon snarling]

00:00:31.885 --> 00:00:34.061
I'm proud to
call you my son.

00:00:35.889 --> 00:00:37.020
Thanks, Dad.

00:00:42.243 --> 00:00:44.637
- [Toothless roars]
- He's up!

00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:48.728
Get Snotlout out of there.

00:00:48.902 --> 00:00:50.469
- I'm on it!
- I'm on it first!

00:00:50.643 --> 00:00:52.079
Hey, let me drive!

00:00:53.733 --> 00:00:56.083
- Don't push me!
- I'll take your teeth out!

00:00:59.739 --> 00:01:01.523
[Snotlout] I can't
believe that worked!

00:01:01.697 --> 00:01:04.091
[sucking in air]

00:01:07.703 --> 00:01:08.922
[divebombing]

00:01:09.096 --> 00:01:10.140
- Night Fury!
- [gasping]

00:01:10.315 --> 00:01:12.099
Get down!

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.669
[screaming]

00:01:22.065 --> 00:01:23.197
Did you get her?

00:01:26.374 --> 00:01:27.245
[playful growl]

00:01:33.338 --> 00:01:34.730
Go.

00:01:34.904 --> 00:01:36.210
That thing has wings.

00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:39.082
OK, let's see
if it can use them!

00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:48.875
[roaring]

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:57.100
You think that did it?

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:01.017
[roaring]

00:02:01.931 --> 00:02:04.020
Well, he can fly.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:15.902
- [cheering]
- [man] Whoo!

00:02:16.076 --> 00:02:17.207
- Go!
- Yeah!

00:02:24.214 --> 00:02:26.913
OK, Toothless,
time to disappear.

00:02:27.783 --> 00:02:29.002
Come on, bud!

00:02:34.355 --> 00:02:36.705
- [shrieks]
- Here it comes!

00:02:53.287 --> 00:02:55.289
[snarling]

00:02:59.859 --> 00:03:01.991
[growling]

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:17.833
- Ooh!
- [gasps]

00:03:20.749 --> 00:03:22.185
[roars]

00:03:28.888 --> 00:03:30.368
Watch out!

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:34.937
OK, time's up!
Let's see if this works.

00:03:36.025 --> 00:03:37.375
[Toothless roars]

00:03:37.549 --> 00:03:39.768
Come on! Is that
the best you can do?!

00:03:47.907 --> 00:03:49.909
[dragon roaring]

00:03:57.612 --> 00:04:00.006
Stay with me, buddy.
We're good. Just a bit longer.

00:04:04.271 --> 00:04:06.229
- Hold, Toothless.
- [shrieking]

00:04:06.491 --> 00:04:08.188
Now!

00:04:14.803 --> 00:04:17.153
[dragon growling]

00:04:18.241 --> 00:04:20.983
[roaring]

00:04:31.951 --> 00:04:33.126
No.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:35.171
- No! Uhh!
- [growls]

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.272
[Stoick coughing]

00:04:50.578 --> 00:04:52.232
Hiccup!

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:55.061
Hiccup!

00:04:55.975 --> 00:04:57.280
Son!

00:04:58.543 --> 00:05:01.415
[gasping] Hiccup.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.940
[panting]

00:05:12.861 --> 00:05:14.863
[moans]

00:05:23.437 --> 00:05:25.134
Oh, son.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.181
I did this.

00:05:33.621 --> 00:05:35.057
[gasps]

00:05:46.895 --> 00:05:49.158
[growls]

00:05:58.037 --> 00:06:01.257
Oh, son, I'm so sorry.

00:06:07.612 --> 00:06:09.004
Hiccup!

00:06:15.054 --> 00:06:18.536
[gasps] He's alive.
You brought him back alive.

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.016
[Vikings laugh and cheer]

00:06:27.414 --> 00:06:30.025
- Ooh!
- [growls and roars]

00:06:35.553 --> 00:06:39.078
Thank you
for saving my son.

00:06:39.252 --> 00:06:42.385
Well, you know...
most of him.

00:06:45.127 --> 00:06:46.999
[soft growl]

00:06:53.092 --> 00:06:54.572
[growls]

00:06:57.139 --> 00:06:58.576
[guttural growl]

00:07:00.708 --> 00:07:02.362
Hey, Toothless.

00:07:02.536 --> 00:07:05.408
I'm happy to see you,
too, buddy.

00:07:05.583 --> 00:07:07.976
[groans] What? Uh...

00:07:08.673 --> 00:07:11.197
I'm in my house.

00:07:11.371 --> 00:07:13.852
- [slurps]
- Uh, you're in my house.

00:07:14.026 --> 00:07:16.202
Does my dad know
you're here? Uh...

00:07:16.376 --> 00:07:18.465
What? Oh, OK, OK.

00:07:18.639 --> 00:07:20.510
Toothless, no.
No, Toothless.

00:07:20.685 --> 00:07:23.383
Toothless! Oh, come on.

